% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: degenerate subpaths follow stroke's rules (PLRM3 §8.2
% stroke, strokepath). A subpath of two coincident points and a closed
% single-point subpath are dots with round caps (page 1 fills their
% outline, page 2 strokes them); with butt caps they are nothing, and
% so is a subpath of one moveto, so pages 3 and 4 are blank.
40 setlinewidth 1 setlinecap
200 300 moveto 200 300 lineto
350 300 moveto closepath
strokepath fill
showpage
40 setlinewidth 1 setlinecap
200 300 moveto 200 300 lineto
350 300 moveto closepath
stroke
showpage
40 setlinewidth 0 setlinecap
200 300 moveto 200 300 lineto
350 300 moveto closepath
450 300 moveto
strokepath fill
showpage
40 setlinewidth 0 setlinecap
200 300 moveto 200 300 lineto
350 300 moveto closepath
450 300 moveto
stroke
showpage
